Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?=E2=9A=A1=EF=B8=8F=20perf:=20improve=20Real=20E?=
 =?UTF-8?q?xperience=20Score=20on=20public=20pages?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add cookie-free Supabase client (@gad/supabase/public) so public pages can be statically rendered with ISR (60s) instead of SSR on every request
- Move article view counting to a client-side tracker so article pages can be cached
- Replace render-blocking Google Fonts @import with next/font (same fonts and CSS variables)
- Fill/sizes on editorial board avatars, sizes on footer and navbar logos
- Enable avif/webp formats and a 30 day image cache TTL
- Use a passive scroll listener in the navbar
- Wrap issue fetchers in React cache() to dedupe per-request calls
